    /// By definition, the tiles are represented by 'State'-s individual.
    ///
    /// Tiles are related to the 'Existent' through temporal direct parthood, enforcing non-transitivity and inverse-functionality.rdfs:comment : 'Existent' is the EMMO class to be used for representing real world physical objects under a reductionistic perspective (i.e. objects come from the composition of sub-part objects, both in time and space).
