    /// For this reason, the EMMO entities that are not quantum or elementaries, may be considered to be always spatiotemporal. The EMMO poses no constraints to the number of spatial dimensions for a causal system (except being higher than one).</para>
    ///   <para>emmo:EMMO_70fe84ff_99b6_4206_a9fc_9a8931836d84 : The disjoint union of the fundamental mereocausal classes of Quantum, CausalPath, CausalSystem and Collection.</para>
